{"author":"cursor[bot]","author_type":"Bot","body":"### Background API missing badge setter\n\n**High Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\nThe new `setPerpsTabBadgeSeen` action calls `submitRequestToBackground('setPerpsTabBadgeSeen', …)`, but that method is not registered on the background `MetamaskController` API alongside other AppState setters (e.g. `setMusdConversionEducationSeen`). Dismissal likely fails at runtime, so the badge may not hide reliably and `perpsTabBadgeSeen` may not persist after reload.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: c21272e2-ad43-4714-bcd2-65c39a9c55a5 --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\nui/store/actions.ts#L7649-L7653\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fix in Web\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\u003csup\u003eReviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 297a56ae760dd73777459e094e9283e157dade60. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).\u003c/sup\u003e\n","created_at":"2026-06-18T14:52:26Z","html_url":"https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/pull/43686#discussion_r3436755064","id":3436755064,"line":7709,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAoEEns7M2Lh4","path":"ui/store/actions.ts","side":"RIGHT"}
{"author":"cursor[bot]","author_type":"Bot","body":"### Duplicate Perp Screen Viewed events\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\nMapping the Perps overview tab to `PerpsScreenViewed` makes `handleTabClick` emit that event on every tab click, but `PerpsView` already fires the same event once loading finishes with Perps-specific properties. Users with Perps enabled get two `Perp Screen Viewed` events per visit, inflating counts and splitting analytics across Home vs Perps categories.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 57dc55a9-e5b2-4f80-8593-3bfa07502c43 --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\nshared/constants/app-state.ts#L19-L20\nui/components/multichain/account-overview/account-overview-tabs.tsx#L147-L163\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eAdditional Locations (1)\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n- [`ui/components/multichain/account-overview/account-overview-tabs.tsx#L147-L163`](https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/blob/297a56ae760dd73777459e094e9283e157dade60/ui/components/multichain/account-overview/account-overview-tabs.tsx#L147-L163)\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"\u003e\u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: lig